eas.\n  - Dave: Dave, who is restoring a vintage Mustang engine, has taken up photography, focusing on local scenery. He discussed his photography and the car project with Calvin.\n  - vintage Mustang: Dave is working on a Ford Mustang he found in a junkyard. He finds working on cars therapeutic to relax. Previously, he had worked on the engine, but heard a weird noise upon starting it.\n  - bench: Dave found a new, peaceful spot with a bench under a tree with pink flowers, perfect for relaxing and taking in the beauty.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2016,"context_chars":7950,"retrieval_duration":0.16954445838928223,"response_duration":2.692742347717285,"total_duration":2.8622868061065674,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer includes all the activities mentioned in the gold answer, such as taking long drives and working on cars, thus addressing the question accurately.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary information to answer the question about how Calvin relaxes. It mentions that Calvin takes long drives, works on cars, and enjoys embracing nature, which aligns perfectly with the elements in the golden answer. Each of these activities is explicitly stated in the context, confirming that it is sufficient to construct a complete answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Calvin uses long drives to help him relax and clear his head.","Working on cars helps Calvin relax and clear his head.","Calvin finds that long drives in this car help him relax.","Calvin finds fixing cars calming."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_7","category":"2","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How many years passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs?","golden_answer":"three years","hypothesis":"Audrey adopted Pixie on April 2, 2023. She has owned her other three dogs (Panda, Pepper, and Precious) since March 27, 2020. \n\