t week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline created a recent self-portrait (event_time: 2023-08-16T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline started being into art when she was about 17 years old. (event_time: 2006-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline uses drawing as a creative activity. (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline creates art. (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline drew something that stands for embracing her womanhood (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline created the painting. (event_time: 2023-07-17T14:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline used painting and drawing to explore her gender identity. (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline uses her art as a way to express herself (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline's self-portrait is an example of her art (event_time: 2023-08-16T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline made a painting to show her path as a trans woman (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline works as an artist. (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline made the painting to show her path (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline created her painting for the art show. (event_time: 2023-07-17T14:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline created the piece she is showing. (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline has found her true self. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline shared a pic. (event_time: 2023-06-09T19:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline puts her feelings on the canvas when creating abstract art. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline has thought about trying another form of art. (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline uses her art to tell her stories. (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline aimed to show warmth, love, and self-acceptance through the painting. (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline is a trans person. (event_time: