l,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_3","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_3_qa_10","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What emotions is Joanna feeling about  the screenplay she submitted?","golden_answer":"Relief, excitement,worry, hope,anxiety.","hypothesis":"Joanna is experiencing a mix of emotions regarding the screenplay she submitted, including relief, excitement, and worry. She also feels a tug-of-war of hope and doubt, along with anxiety about future recognition and the possibility of her screenplay being noticed.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Joanna is experiencing emotions like relief, excitement, and worry regarding her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna has wild feelings (relief and anxiety) regarding her second screenplay. (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes her screenplay gets noticed and makes it to the screen. (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes for positive feedback regarding her completed screenplay. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna cannot stop thinking about the screenplay (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna is finding the recent experience of finishing her script a wild ride. (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes her screenplay ends up on the big screen. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Movies can make Joanna feel many emotions. (event_time: 2022-10-09T10:58:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes a director will fall in love with her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09